@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":StorageManager" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

note over Logic, Command
  Inside LogicManager.execute(...), after parsing.
  AddCommand and Student already exist;
  the LogicManager activation is omitted.
end note
note right of Logic : The pre-command data snapshot is omitted.
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : hasStudent(student)
activate Model
Model --> Command : false
deactivate Model
Command -> Model : addStudent(student)
activate Model
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command -> Model : updateFilteredStudentList(...)
activate Model
note right of Model
  Restore the full displayed roster
  and discard transient sorting.
  The panel observes the list changes.
end note
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command --> Logic : success result
deactivate Command
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(updatedData)
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic
deactivate Storage
[<-- Logic : result

note over Logic, Storage
  Current integrated design: valid fields, unique student, successful save.
  Save-failure rollback is described in "Saving after a command".
end note
@enduml
